  "description": "*“Here, fantasy becomes reality! If you survive, that is.”*\n\nThe protagonist arrives at a bizarre amusement park while searching for his missing daughter. A monster wearing a puppet mask appears before him and tells him that if he wants to find his daughter, he must play the games at the amusement park and survive. A death game thriller in which the protagonist must survive the deadly games set up at the amusement park to find his missing daughter.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
